      interpretationMixedWitnessSuffix:
        'Excluded as INACTIVE and NOT treated as save-abort suspects: {witnessIds} — these are Draft/Obsolete Flows or Inactive triggers/rules that do not run, so they could not have aborted the save (they remain in the org and could if reactivated).',
